What is the output of the following Java program using a method reference with standard functional interfaces?
```java
import java.util.function.Function;
class WordTransformer {
    public static String shout(String s) { return s.toUpperCase() + "!"; }
}
public class WordApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Function<String, String> f = WordTransformer::shout;
        System.out.println(f.apply("hello"));
    }
}
```

