What is the output of the following Java program using default method composition on Predicate?
```java
import java.util.function.Predicate;
public class PredicateApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Predicate<Integer> isPositive = n -> n > 0;
        Predicate<Integer> isEven = n -> n % 2 == 0;
        Predicate<Integer> check = isPositive.and(isEven).negate();
        System.out.println(check.test(4) + " " + check.test(-2));
    }
}
```
